{{Quote|I am thrilled to announce that currently, due to the hard work of our tireless Pathfinder team, Seventy-one-Beenine&mdash;we can now celebrate the opening of a new hyperlane that will bring Eiram and E'ronoh access to one of the most resource-rich areas in the Outer Rim. The Hetzal system.|Orlen Mollo|<ref name="Cataclysm" />}}
A '''hyperlane''' was opened in the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]]<ref name="Cataclysm" /> in [[382 BBY]] to connect<ref name="High Republic Character Encyclopedia" /> the [[Dalnan sector]]<ref name="Convergence">''[[The High Republic: Convergence]]''</ref> [[planet]]s [[Eiram]] and [[E'ronoh]] to the [[Hetzal system]]<ref name="Cataclysm" /> in the [[Savareen sector]].<ref name="Appendix">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}} &mdash; Based on corresponding data for the [[Hetzal system]]</ref> It was established by the [[Galactic Republic]] [[Pathfinder team 71-B9]] and officially opened by Republic [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Orlen Mollo]] during a [[Ceremony on Eirie|ceremony]] on Eiram and E'ronoh's shared [[moon]] [[Eirie]].<ref name="Cataclysm" />

